{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2025-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1750032000, "end_date": 1750636799, "month_true_total": 108, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:01:45 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "197922315", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006521459", "personaname": "Ryvucz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198006521459/", "num_games_owned": 374, "num_reviews": 177, "playtime_forever": 1201, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 900, "last_played": 1751149522, "avatar": "a0c18451fbc4a7844556f9d4652f460085aab904"}, "language": "english", "review": "Make sure it's on sale, for a very deep discount. This game is very bad.\n\nThe story is poorly written, the team mate AI is better thought of as 3 year olds with a controller, they're that effective.\n\nThe game is buggy and open world conversations can be interrupted by just moving. They often stop conversations, or just start multiple conversations at the same time.\n\nEnemy AI flank and rush. Friendly AI just derp around in one spot.\n\nEnemy AI is designed to go after the player, avoiding the friendly AI majority of the time.\n\nThe enemy can be right next to a friendly AI, the enemy AI will shoot you, while the friendly AI derps in one spot.\n\nSometimes, the game will spawn infinite enemies.\n\nSometimes, while clicking a conversation response with your mouse, the mouse cursor will be stuck on the screen until you exit the game.", "timestamp_created": 1750636650, "timestamp_updated": 1750638322, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.489810287952423096", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197783324", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047433456", "personaname": "imre.vigh", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198047433456/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3029, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2168, "last_played": 1752950864, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Altough the story is not that strong than in the trilogy and it has some very frustrating bugs, it's a great game that is very underrated.", "timestamp_created": 1750507837, "timestamp_updated": 1750507837, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197753087", "author": {"steamid": "76561198242003246", "personaname": "Keyofsouls", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198242003246/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 1211, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1211, "last_played": 1594136364, "avatar": "62b92a25544d5d39539eadea04e3a2580a9a3c0e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not an amazing game to begin with but it was alright. Sadly It no longer wants to download on steam and thus I can't play it anymore. Since it's the only game I own that has this issue I can only assume it's another EA ♥♥♥♥ up probably something to do with their own launcher/app/storefront making things break and since i can't play it It can take my negative review. \r\n\r\nHonestly typical of that garbage company.", "timestamp_created": 1750474984, "timestamp_updated": 1750474984, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 16, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.635240375995635986", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197734123", "author": {"steamid": "76561198016542807", "personaname": "AtomicWinter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198016542807/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 113, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 113, "last_played": 1750528327, "avatar": "0e165a875f6c8e93170884a3b5ad78d9f8bf7db7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've never played a Mass Effect game before. I heard to play this one first before the trilogy... So, I bought the trilogy and this during a sale. I am glad I got this because so far I'm loving the game play and the story. If the trilogy is better than this, then I'm in for a good time. The open world feels good, the gun play feels OK, etc. There is a lot to take in and learn, but I feel like it's a good investment to make. I'll definitely be playing more of this.", "timestamp_created": 1750453573, "timestamp_updated": 1750453573, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "197724514", "author": {"steamid": "76561198360913552", "personaname": "verasithea", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198360913552/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 7586, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4839, "last_played": 1764455016, "avatar": "a8c5d92192f114f5ed05a03a86e53facc7d22a27"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yep", "timestamp_created": 1750444941, "timestamp_updated": 1750444941, "voted_up": true, "vot